WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.562
Episode 2
A Nightmare

00:06.039 --> 00:10.135
So you were childhood friends
with that transfer student, Kotori?

00:10.243 --> 00:11.403
I'm jealous.

00:11.511 --> 00:15.277
Say, was Shirou that quiet
when he was a little boy?

00:15.382 --> 00:16.872
He wasn't that bad...

00:16.983 --> 00:19.281
...but I think he changed quite a bit.

00:19.386 --> 00:21.513
He acted so nonchalantly
towards me.

00:21.621 --> 00:23.612
Well,
it's that time in our lives.

00:23.724 --> 00:27.023
Besides, maybe boys are shy
about childhood friends.

00:27.127 --> 00:29.618
Yeah, something like that
happened to me, too.

00:29.730 --> 00:31.755
Boys always put up a front.

00:31.865 --> 00:34.425
Well, sometimes that's
what's so cute about them.

00:34.534 --> 00:36.627
Oh, you're pretty mature...

00:36.737 --> 00:39.604
...for someone who took baths
with her dad until recently.

00:39.706 --> 00:41.230
Don't bring that up!

00:43.310 --> 00:45.904
I need to go buy groceries
for dinner, so see ya!

00:46.012 --> 00:46.910
Yeah, see ya!

00:47.013 --> 00:47.980
Bye bye!

01:09.469 --> 01:10.902
We're climbing further?

01:11.004 --> 01:11.868
Just a bit.

01:11.972 --> 01:14.497
It's only a bit further
so do your best, Kamui!

01:15.976 --> 01:17.807
I'm a little scared...

01:17.911 --> 01:18.843
It's all right!

01:18.945 --> 01:20.435
You're a boy, right?

01:20.547 --> 01:22.242
See, it's right there!

01:24.151 --> 01:25.709
W-Where?

01:25.819 --> 01:27.081
Is it really right there?

01:29.723 --> 01:30.587
See?

01:30.690 --> 01:31.679
You're right.

01:31.792 --> 01:32.690
Well, let's go.

01:43.537 --> 01:45.698
Don't fall from
the nest again, okay?

01:50.777 --> 01:52.039
I'm glad.

01:52.145 --> 01:53.612
It's so happy!

01:53.713 --> 01:54.645
You're right.

01:54.748 --> 01:55.976
- It's great.
- Yeah.

01:57.284 --> 01:58.376
Huh?

01:58.485 --> 01:59.383
Something just...

02:07.127 --> 02:09.152
I'm scared! I'm scared!

02:09.262 --> 02:11.355
Hold still, Kotori.

02:11.465 --> 02:13.365
I'll never let go of you.

02:14.601 --> 02:16.068
Kamui...

02:17.137 --> 02:19.105
I won't let go of you...

02:19.206 --> 02:20.104
Ever.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.647
Kamui...

02:29.216 --> 02:30.911
Kamui...

02:31.017 --> 02:32.109
...are you dead?

02:33.253 --> 02:34.584
Kamui...

02:34.688 --> 02:37.088
- Hurry!
- Stay still like that!

02:37.190 --> 02:38.953
Keep at it, Kamui!

02:39.059 --> 02:40.117
Are you all right?

02:40.227 --> 02:42.354
- Because of me, Kamui...
- It's all right now, see?

02:45.632 --> 02:46.496
Huh?

02:46.600 --> 02:47.794
Fuma.

02:47.901 --> 02:49.198
Great job, Kamui.

02:49.302 --> 02:50.929
You protected Kotori.

02:51.037 --> 02:52.937
- Really?
- Really.

02:53.039 --> 02:54.734
I promise you...

02:54.841 --> 02:57.366
...that when something
happens to you, I'll protect you.

02:57.477 --> 02:59.206
I'll definitely keep this promise.

03:00.814 --> 03:02.611
Thanks, Kamui...

03:18.031 --> 03:20.556
They're shy about
childhood friends, huh?

03:21.868 --> 03:22.732
I guess so.

03:23.904 --> 03:25.030
I'm sure that's it!

03:30.810 --> 03:33.040
I've had enough of you, damn it.

03:33.146 --> 03:35.671
Hey, you've been
keeping awfully quiet now.

03:35.782 --> 03:36.646
Say something!

03:37.717 --> 03:40.185
You've at least got
a little money, don't you?

03:40.287 --> 03:42.482
Hurry up and pay up.

03:42.589 --> 03:44.420
What's with that look?

03:44.524 --> 03:47.322
I don't like you one bit,
and you just came here!

03:47.427 --> 03:48.917
Hold on!

03:49.029 --> 03:50.894
What are you guys doing?

03:50.997 --> 03:52.328
What?

03:52.432 --> 03:54.093
We're just having a little talk.

03:54.200 --> 03:56.134
It's none of your business,
so get lost!

03:56.236 --> 03:58.101
Hey, you're getting in our way.

03:59.372 --> 04:00.771
S-She's Monou's...

04:00.874 --> 04:01.863
...little sister!

04:01.975 --> 04:02.839
Monou?

04:02.943 --> 04:05.207
That huge junior
on the basketball team.

04:05.312 --> 04:07.212
Hmph, like I'd know that!

04:11.151 --> 04:12.743
What? You're gonna quit?

04:16.323 --> 04:17.790
W-What's the matter?

04:17.891 --> 04:19.756
Hey, are you all right?

04:19.859 --> 04:20.985
What happened?

04:21.094 --> 04:22.891
Did he do something to you?

04:22.996 --> 04:25.226
Maybe we should
take him to a doctor?

04:25.332 --> 04:26.856
All right, let's go.

04:26.967 --> 04:28.935
Idiot, don't touch me there!

04:29.035 --> 04:30.832
- Come on, stand up already.
- That hurts!

04:32.405 --> 04:34.839
I saw him at school, too.

04:34.941 --> 04:36.135
Did you talk to him at all?

04:36.242 --> 04:37.504
No.

04:37.611 --> 04:39.340
I thought it looked like him...

04:39.446 --> 04:42.108
...but I didn't really
think that he was Kamui.

04:42.215 --> 04:45.241
The air about him
has changed quite a bit.

04:45.352 --> 04:48.321
I initially thought he was
just a little shy about things...

04:48.421 --> 04:50.013
But something is different.

04:50.123 --> 04:52.421
Like a different person
from the old Kamui.

04:52.525 --> 04:54.356
He was such a kind person.

04:54.461 --> 04:56.088
Don't worry about it.

04:56.196 --> 04:58.562
I'm sure we'll be able
to get along like before.

04:58.665 --> 05:00.462
Well, I'll be right back.

05:00.567 --> 05:02.159
- Practice?
- Yeah.

05:02.268 --> 05:04.532
- The tournament's coming soon.
- Do your best!

05:07.407 --> 05:08.305
Father?

05:09.576 --> 05:10.600
Is something wrong?

05:10.710 --> 05:11.938
Oh, nothing...

05:12.045 --> 05:14.775
I heard that Kamui
transferred back here?

05:14.881 --> 05:15.779
Yeah.

05:18.785 --> 05:20.082
It's just as Fuma said.

05:22.022 --> 05:23.489
No need to worry.

05:23.590 --> 05:25.751
Kamui is a kind boy.

05:25.859 --> 05:28.885
He really was kind
when he was little...

05:28.995 --> 05:32.294
I'm sure he hasn't
forgotten the memories of his past.

05:33.400 --> 05:34.526
You really think so?

05:35.635 --> 05:36.533
Of course.

06:12.605 --> 06:13.867
Do you want something?

06:13.973 --> 06:17.272
You didn't have to break
the bones in his wrist.

06:17.377 --> 06:19.368
Are you here to get even
for your friend?

06:20.480 --> 06:23.540
It looks like you don't know
how to control your power.

06:23.650 --> 06:26.175
I can't begin to believe
you're the real "Kamui."

06:28.121 --> 06:29.281
So confusing.

06:29.389 --> 06:31.050
You're someone from that crowd.

06:33.426 --> 06:34.825
Don't fret, I'm here...

06:34.928 --> 06:36.395
...to see things through, right?

06:37.464 --> 06:40.262
On whether or not I'm worthy
to wield the Divine Sword.

06:40.366 --> 06:43.130
Yeah, I'm taking a nice,
long time to observe.

06:44.204 --> 06:47.298
It may be fun for you,
but it's unpleasant for me.

06:48.374 --> 06:51.241
I'm sure it would be if we're
looking at the wrong person.

06:53.346 --> 06:56.008
I'll show you if you're
looking at the right guy or not.

06:56.116 --> 06:58.949
Stop it. Think what would happen
if you started things here.

07:02.355 --> 07:03.549
Stop it!

07:03.656 --> 07:05.590
Are you going to involve
ordinary civilians?

07:05.692 --> 07:07.023
Like I care about that!

07:15.135 --> 07:16.033
What a guy!

07:34.654 --> 07:36.087
Oh?

07:36.189 --> 07:37.679
You're still alive.

07:37.791 --> 07:39.349
You sure are tough.

07:39.459 --> 07:41.450
Completely different
from those Spell Servants.

07:51.704 --> 07:52.762
Damn you...

07:52.872 --> 07:55.102
Someone so selfish like you...

08:00.280 --> 08:01.975
...can't possibly be "Kamui"!

08:05.985 --> 08:07.953
Furthermore,
with only this much power...

08:09.055 --> 08:12.889
Princess Hinoto's dreamgazing
can't prove false, but...

08:12.992 --> 08:14.584
What are you mumbling?

08:20.433 --> 08:21.559
Where are you looking?

08:21.668 --> 08:22.566
Over here!

08:24.204 --> 08:26.172
I'm the one, true Kamui!

08:47.527 --> 08:48.960
Wasting my time like that...

08:51.097 --> 08:52.121
Answer me.

08:52.232 --> 08:54.325
Who's the one
commanding all of you?

08:55.401 --> 08:56.834
Tell me!

08:56.936 --> 08:57.834
Hold on.

09:01.007 --> 09:03.100
The fight has
already been settled.

09:03.209 --> 09:04.699
You're the ones
who attacked first.

09:05.812 --> 09:07.609
I have no wish to fight you.

09:08.781 --> 09:10.339
You should treat those wounds.

09:10.450 --> 09:12.077
Don't mouth off!

09:12.185 --> 09:14.813
I won't forgive anyone
who gets in my way!

09:23.096 --> 09:24.825
I will see you again shortly.

09:26.199 --> 09:27.097
Wait!

09:33.039 --> 09:33.937
Damn it.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.858
Who is it?

09:57.563 --> 09:58.996
What are you doing there?

10:00.934 --> 10:02.162
Did something happen?

10:03.703 --> 10:04.692
Kamui!

10:04.804 --> 10:05.771
It's you, Kamui!

10:08.207 --> 10:10.141
What's wrong? Those wounds...

10:10.243 --> 10:11.437
Wait.

10:11.544 --> 10:13.535
Did someone get you back
for this afternoon?

10:13.646 --> 10:15.136
I heard about it from Kotori.

10:16.215 --> 10:17.307
Don't push yourself.

10:17.417 --> 10:18.543
You're bleeding heavily!

10:19.652 --> 10:20.914
It's nothing...

10:21.020 --> 10:22.647
Nonsense,
I can't leave you alone.

10:22.755 --> 10:24.518
Don't be so hesitant.

10:24.624 --> 10:25.556
Don't involve yourself with me.

10:27.060 --> 10:28.823
What's wrong, Kamui?

10:28.928 --> 10:30.293
Are you serious?

10:30.396 --> 10:31.385
That's right.

10:31.497 --> 10:33.465
Something's wrong with you!

10:33.566 --> 10:35.761
Yeah, there's
something wrong with me.

10:35.868 --> 10:37.802
That's why you
shouldn't bother with me.

10:39.238 --> 10:40.136
Kamui...

10:55.321 --> 10:57.949
He's the kinda fellow
that's hard to deal with...

10:59.058 --> 11:00.719
Princess Hinoto...

11:00.827 --> 11:04.786
I am not one of the Seven Seals
like Lady Arashi.

11:04.897 --> 11:08.230
I am but a servant
who serves you, Princess.

11:09.635 --> 11:14.004
But even from my eyes, I cannot
possibly think he is "Kamui."

11:14.107 --> 11:17.201
It is true that he has
tremendous powers...

11:17.310 --> 11:18.800
However...

11:18.911 --> 11:22.403
A human who doesn't care
about involving innocent civilians...

11:23.683 --> 11:25.810
...cannot possibly be "Kamui."

11:25.918 --> 11:28.819
I understand, Lord Saiki.

11:28.921 --> 11:31.719
Now, hurry and tend
to your wounds.

11:31.824 --> 11:33.155
Come. This way.

11:37.196 --> 11:38.857
Lady Arashi.

11:38.965 --> 11:40.398
What did you think?

11:42.335 --> 11:44.428
I agree with Lord Saiki...

11:44.537 --> 11:47.267
...that we should not hand him
the Divine Sword just yet.

11:47.373 --> 11:48.203
I see.

11:49.542 --> 11:50.770
Princess Hinoto...

11:50.877 --> 11:53.209
Why do you believe
that he is "Kamui"?

11:54.547 --> 11:58.984
What sort of things did you see
in your dreamgazing exactly?

12:01.287 --> 12:03.050
The end of this world.

12:14.133 --> 12:17.364
He was there at this world's end.

12:19.172 --> 12:22.869
He saw me as I was
walking across dreams.

12:24.744 --> 12:29.147
He surely saw my figure,
something he could not have seen.

12:32.385 --> 12:34.785
And the boy from the other day...

12:37.490 --> 12:40.584
The two figures that
I saw within my heart...

12:40.693 --> 12:43.389
...were most definitely
one and the same.

12:44.464 --> 12:45.488
That means...

12:45.598 --> 12:46.690
Yes.

12:46.799 --> 12:51.259
It means "Kamui"
has not completely awoken yet.

12:51.370 --> 12:54.168
Either that, or my dreamgazing
was incorrect.

12:55.341 --> 12:58.401
No, your powers
we can be sure of.

12:58.511 --> 13:00.376
I know how all the people...

13:00.480 --> 13:03.881
...who have come here
were saved by your predictions.

13:05.852 --> 13:08.582
Princess,
someone is here to see you.

13:09.689 --> 13:11.850
Then I will be on my way.

13:11.958 --> 13:12.856
Lady Arashi.

13:13.926 --> 13:16.224
I would like you
to watch over that boy...

13:16.329 --> 13:20.527
...and see things through
for a while longer.

13:20.633 --> 13:22.760
Yes.
Until "Kamui" awakens.

13:28.674 --> 13:29.936
The Seven Seals...

13:31.010 --> 13:33.103
And Lady Arashi,
one of the seven...

13:34.347 --> 13:35.780
Please...

13:35.882 --> 13:37.349
Protect "Kamui."

13:41.087 --> 13:43.419
"Kamui" holds
the key to this world.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.788
Please protect him.

14:05.411 --> 14:07.743
I believe that
her dreamgazing is correct.

14:09.482 --> 14:11.507
The fortuneteller bound by duty...

14:11.617 --> 14:14.450
...to gaze through dreams,
sacrificing everything she had.

14:16.022 --> 14:19.287
The prophetess who continually
supports the world from shadows.

14:19.392 --> 14:20.290
Hinoto.

14:22.028 --> 14:25.657
This world's end that she saw...

14:25.765 --> 14:26.663
What was it?

14:54.627 --> 14:57.027
Sheesh,
this is turning out real strange.

14:58.097 --> 15:00.827
I was just about to approach
and talk to Kamui...

15:02.134 --> 15:04.125
But some guy
in a school uniform comes out...

15:04.237 --> 15:06.262
...and they fly
happily away together.

15:06.372 --> 15:08.897
Then a missie with a sword
in her hand shows up...

15:09.008 --> 15:11.442
...and a guy playing
basketball comes out.

15:12.511 --> 15:15.173
I really lost my chance
to talk to him!

15:17.316 --> 15:18.180
What should I do?

15:22.922 --> 15:25.584
What, you're thinking
something too, mister?

15:25.691 --> 15:27.488
Well, you could say that.

15:27.593 --> 15:30.187
I'm just a passerby,
so don't worry about me.

15:30.296 --> 15:31.695
A passerby?

15:31.797 --> 15:34.925
If you're just a passerby,
you wouldn't be on top of a tree.

15:35.034 --> 15:39.334
Well, the stars are beautiful,
so I thought I'd go out on a walk.

15:39.438 --> 15:41.030
You're a funny guy, mister.

15:44.844 --> 15:47.278
So, you have some
business with Kamui, too?

15:48.347 --> 15:50.781
If so, what will you do about it?

15:50.883 --> 15:53.408
Are you related to that guy
in the school uniform?

15:53.519 --> 15:54.577
I'm not.

15:54.687 --> 15:56.348
In either case...

15:56.455 --> 15:58.787
I want you to wait
until my business is done.

16:09.502 --> 16:11.367
So this is a Barrier Field...

16:11.470 --> 16:13.267
This is the first time I've seen one.

16:13.372 --> 16:16.830
A kilometer on all sides has been
cut into an alternate dimension.

16:16.942 --> 16:17.772
An amazing thing.

16:19.245 --> 16:21.645
I'm a pacifistic hooligan.

16:21.747 --> 16:24.045
It'd be bad to trouble
ordinary folks, right?

16:25.084 --> 16:28.713
If I do this, no damage goes
to the actual material plane.

16:28.821 --> 16:30.448
With no interruptions...

16:31.957 --> 16:34.016
...we can thrash about as we wish.

16:34.126 --> 16:35.991
That's what it means.

16:36.095 --> 16:37.392
Putting up a Barrier Field...

16:37.496 --> 16:40.124
...will turn that space into
a completely different dimension...

16:40.232 --> 16:42.894
...and not affect the original
material plane, it's true.

16:43.002 --> 16:45.129
But if the one who puts up
the Barrier Field dies...

16:45.237 --> 16:48.832
...or is critically injured,
the material plane will be affected.

16:48.941 --> 16:50.033
You know a lot.

16:50.142 --> 16:51.837
Oh, I just heard it from someone.

16:52.978 --> 16:54.104
You wanna try it out?

16:55.181 --> 16:57.706
If ya wanna get out
of this Barrier Field, mister...

16:57.817 --> 16:59.307
...ya gotta kill me first.

17:01.387 --> 17:02.445
It looks that way.

17:03.656 --> 17:04.953
So you are, as I thought...

17:05.057 --> 17:08.891
Looks like we're both involved with
the End of the World.

17:08.994 --> 17:09.858
Looks it.

17:10.930 --> 17:12.557
We haven't
introduced ourselves yet!

17:12.665 --> 17:14.633
I'm Sorata Arisugawa!

17:20.406 --> 17:22.306
A cute,
playful high school junior!

17:24.076 --> 17:25.737
Thanks for
the detailed introduction.

17:32.985 --> 17:34.680
I'm Yuto Kigai.

17:34.787 --> 17:37.347
An ordinary public servant
from the ward office.

17:37.456 --> 17:39.890
Mister, you don't look like
a public servant.

17:39.992 --> 17:41.823
I thought you were
from the red-light district.

17:41.927 --> 17:43.827
People tell me that all the time.

17:46.265 --> 17:49.393
Pretty good, mister,
for someone who looks like a pimp.

17:49.502 --> 17:52.699
Same to you, little boy
who's like a stand-up comic.

17:52.805 --> 17:55.000
You really are
a funny guy, mister.

17:55.107 --> 17:56.597
Your compliments make me blush.

18:11.957 --> 18:12.855
What?

18:20.933 --> 18:22.525
Why is someone
in the Barrier Field?

18:22.635 --> 18:24.694
Who is it?
He's not one of your friends?

18:24.804 --> 18:25.702
He ain't.

18:26.672 --> 18:27.730
Wha...

18:27.840 --> 18:29.364
What in the world is this?

18:31.710 --> 18:34.838
Sorata, I guess we'll
call it a draw for today.

18:34.947 --> 18:36.744
Guess so.
We've got no choice.

18:52.698 --> 18:55.690
W-What in the world is going on?

18:55.801 --> 18:57.735
Am I hallucinating?

18:57.837 --> 18:59.134
It's strange...

18:59.238 --> 19:01.433
There isn't a scratch anywhere.

19:01.540 --> 19:03.508
My Barrier Field was
100 percent perfect.

19:04.610 --> 19:05.508
And yet...

19:06.745 --> 19:07.643
How did he...

19:12.251 --> 19:14.446
There's no way
an ordinary human...

19:14.553 --> 19:17.113
...can enter a Barrier Field
created by the empowered.

19:21.093 --> 19:22.617
What the hell is he?

19:23.696 --> 19:26.062
Really.
What in the world is he?

19:27.166 --> 19:30.067
Sorata,
I'll be on my way now.

19:30.169 --> 19:33.070
I'll give you the right
to approach "Kamui" first.

19:33.172 --> 19:37.040
Mister, we should settle the score
for this real soon.

19:37.142 --> 19:38.336
I look forward to it.

19:39.445 --> 19:40.343
See you.

19:44.650 --> 19:47.050
Yuto Kigai, was it?

19:48.387 --> 19:50.082
He's not someone to take lightly.

20:15.948 --> 20:18.143
I'm one of Kamui's friends.

20:18.250 --> 20:19.274
You want something?

20:19.385 --> 20:20.909
H-Hey!

20:21.020 --> 20:23.818
Kamui!
It's me, Fuma!

20:23.923 --> 20:24.947
Are your injuries all right?

20:26.525 --> 20:28.459
If you're all right,
answer me, Kamui!

20:30.262 --> 20:31.661
Kamui, answer me.

20:33.465 --> 20:34.397
That's strange.

20:34.500 --> 20:36.900
I just saw him go inside...

20:38.237 --> 20:42.173
I-If you're worried,
shouldn't we look in?

20:42.274 --> 20:43.935
Kamui, I'm opening the door.

20:50.749 --> 20:52.148
K-Kamui!
